	(text "16MHz crystal has a load capacitance of 10pF\n32.768KHz has a load capacitance of 12.5pF\n16MHz Ask Cosmin\n32.768KHz ABS07-32.768KHZ-T\n\nR1 value will be determined  when we have the pcb\n0 Ohm until then\n\nVBAT charging must be disabled in CubeIDE before\nprogramming can start\n\nVDDA - ADCs/DACs/OPAMPs/COMPs/VREFBUF start\nVDDUSB - separate power supply for USB transceiver"
